         <section id="overview"><!-- Section: Overview - S -->
            <div class="row align-content-center">
               <div class="col">
                  <h2 class="section-heading">About Dotom Isle by Dotom realty</h2>
                                    <p><p>Dotom Isle by Dotom realty is a premium residential development located in the lush and well-connected Malad West, Mumbai Andheri-Dahisar. Dotom Isle is spread across  acres. Dotom Isle features 1 magnificent towers that rise  floors high, offering spacious and thoughtfully designed 1 BHK 2 BHK 3 BHK residences. Each home at Dotom Isle MALAD is crafted to provide a fine balance of comfort, elegance, and modern lifestyle for discerning homebuyers seeking the perfect urban retreat.</p>

<p>Dotom Isle offers an exclusive living experience with a range of lifestyle-enhancing amenities such as Gymnasium,Cafeter</p>
                  <p><span class="more-cont"><span class="d-block">a,Power Backup,Swimming Pool,Intercom,Landscape Garden,Children Play Area,Multipurpose Room,Club House,Lift,Garden,Fire Prevention,Security,Parking,Shopping,CCTV. Every detail of Dotom Isle reflects Dotom realty’s commitment to superior design, construction quality, and a sustainable environment. Homes are designed to ensure ample sunlight, cross ventilation, and panoramic views.</p>

<p>Strategically located in Malad West, Mumbai Andheri-Dahisar, Dotom Isle enjoys excellent connectivity to key parts of MALAD. It is well connected to top schools, hospitals, shopping complexes, and entertainment hubs.</p>

<p>Dotom realty, a name synonymous with excellence and trust, has consistently delivered iconic real estate landmarks. With Dotom Isle, the developer continues its legacy of crafting lifestyle-driven homes combining innovation, functionality, and long-term value.</p>

<ul>
  <li>Spread across  acres in Malad West, Mumbai Andheri-Dahisar</li>
  <li>1 high-rise towers with  floors</li>
  <li>Spacious 1 BHK 2 BHK 3 BHK luxury residences</li>
